---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Content as Home } from '../content/home.md';
import { Content as CrimeLede } from '../content/crime-data-lede.md';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="As-If Science Jam — Schmiede26">
  <section class="border-b border-line pb-10">
    <p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-accent">Schmiede26 · Hallein, Austria</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.1rem,5.2vw,3.6rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-.025em]">
      As-If Science Jam
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[62ch] text-[clamp(1.05rem,2.1vw,1.45rem)] leading-snug text-accent">
      When Science Becomes Play — and Suddenly Makes Sense
    </p>
    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href={`${base}/downloads`}
         class="rounded border border-accent bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-accent no-underline hover:bg-accent/20">Get set up →</a>
      <a href={`${base}/datasets`}
         class="rounded border border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">The datasets</a>
      <a href={`${base}/examples`}
         class="rounded border border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">Examples</a>
      <a href="https://schmiedehallein.com/archives/4731" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
         class="rounded border border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">At Schmiede ↗</a>
    </div>
    <dl class="mt-9 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-4">
      {[['16–26 Sep','2026'],['Hallein','Schmiede, Austria'],['11','datasets, all licensed'],['subnet','a format by Michael Hackl']].map(([a,b]) => (
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[1.45rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.01em]">{a}</dt>
          <dd class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.09em] text-faint">{b}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-accent/50 pl-5 sm:pl-7">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-accent">Why crime</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-[26ch] text-[clamp(1.25rem,2.6vw,1.7rem)] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-.012em]">
      Crime Data as a Subject for an “As-if Science Jam”
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[12px] text-faint">Walter Fuchs · Professor of Criminology, Berlin School of Economics and Law</p>
    <article class="prose mt-4"><CrimeLede /></article>
    <a href={`${base}/crime-data`}
       class="mt-4 inline-block rounded border border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
      Read the full text →
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-10">
    <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-accent">Examples</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-[30ch] text-[clamp(1.25rem,2.6vw,1.7rem)] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-.012em]">
      Four folders you can copy and run
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-[64ch] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Each one is a real dataset with a claim attached that is not true, and everything needed to
      argue it: the data already in place, the task, and an <code class="rounded bg-accent/10 px-1 font-mono text-[.9em] text-ink">.Rproj</code>
      to open. Two of them are written up here.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded border border-line bg-line sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a href={`${base}/examples/trees-and-culture`} class="bg-panel p-5 no-underline hover:bg-accent/5">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-accent">Worked all the way through</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Fell the oaks, fund the theatre</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          A poster with an R² of 0.906 in which every number is correct and the conclusion is
          nonsense. The chain is published and signed — and refuted on the same page.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href={`${base}/examples/murder`} class="bg-panel p-5 no-underline hover:bg-accent/5">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-accent">The hard one</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Inequality and homicide</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Forty-six countries and a relationship that is genuinely there, which is exactly what
          makes it difficult to argue honestly. Compiled by Walter Fuchs.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <a href={`${base}/examples`}
       class="mt-4 inline-block rounded border border-line px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-muted no-underline hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
      All four examples →
    </a>
  </section>

  <article class="prose mt-12 border-t border-line pt-10"><Home /></article>
</Base>
